#                 TE at y = 208.543428 mm (tilt 3.576626 deg); then 200 horizontal sections,
#                 y = 199.498747 down to y = 0.000000 mm, evenly spaced
# layout        : horizontal step dz = 1.002506266 mm; the top horizontal section sits
#                 d = 0.501253133 mm below the top of the LE (d = dz / 2)
# point order   : Selig, TE -> upper -> LE -> lower -> TE
# columns       : x_mm y_mm in that section's own airfoil frame, x = 0 at its LE
#                 and growing aft, y = thickness with the +Z side positive
